---
import logoDark from '../assets/hub/loop-logo-on-dark.svg';
import logoLight from '../assets/hub/loop-logo-on-light.svg';
import { SITE, CONTACT, LAB, REPO } from './data';
---

<section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
	<div class="wrap cta__in" data-reveal>
		<h2 id="cta-title" class="cta__title">Ne vuoi una così per la tua attività?</h2>
		<p class="cta__lead">
			Raccontaci cosa fai e a chi vuoi parlare. Ti rispondiamo con una proposta pensata per te, non con un
			template.
		</p>
		<a class="btn" href={CONTACT}>Parliamone <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
	</div>
</section>

<footer class="ftr">
	<div class="wrap ftr__in">
		<div class="ftr__brand">
			<a href={SITE} aria-label="Loop Studio, vai al sito dello studio" class="ftr__logo">
				<img class="logo logo--dark" src={logoDark.src} alt="" width="95" height="50" />
				<img class="logo logo--light" src={logoLight.src} alt="" width="95" height="50" />
			</a>
			<p>Diamo forma alla tua presenza online.</p>
		</div>
		<nav class="ftr__links" aria-label="Link dello studio">
			<a href={SITE}>Sito dello studio</a>
			<a href={LAB}>Lab: esperimenti e componenti</a>
			<a href={CONTACT}>Contatti</a>
			<a href={REPO} rel="noopener">Il codice su GitHub</a>
		</nav>
	</div>
	<div class="wrap">
		<p class="ftr__note">
			Le vetrine sono concept dimostrativi: attività, nomi, indirizzi e recensioni sono di fantasia. Le foto
			provengono da Unsplash e sono usate secondo la sua licenza.
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.cta {
		position: relative;
		padding: clamp(70px, 10vw, 140px) 0;
		text-align: center;
		overflow: hidden;
		isolation: isolate;
	}
	.cta::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: -1;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 24%, transparent), transparent 70%);
	}
	.cta__in {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.cta__title {
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.6vw, 4.4rem);
		line-height: 1.04;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		max-width: 18ch;
	}
	.cta__lead {
		margin: 22px 0 34px;
		max-width: 46ch;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.ftr {
		padding: 48px 0 36px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.ftr__in {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 32px;
	}
	.ftr__logo {
		display: inline-flex;
		line-height: 0;
	}
	.logo {
		height: 40px;
		width: auto;
	}
	.logo--light {
		display: none;
	}
	:global(:root[data-theme='light']) .logo--dark {
		display: none;
	}
	:global(:root[data-theme='light']) .logo--light {
		display: block;
	}
	.ftr__brand p {
		margin-top: 14px;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.ftr__links {
		display: grid;
		gap: 4px;
		align-content: start;
	}
	.ftr__links a {
		padding: 6px 0;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		transition: color 0.25s;
	}
	.ftr__links a:hover {
		color: var(--text);
	}
	.ftr__note {
		max-width: 70ch;
		margin-top: 36px;
		padding-top: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
</style>
